Here's an example query to try out:

```graphql
query getUsers {
  getUsers(first: 2) {
    edges {
      node {
        id
        name
        occupation
        age
      }
      cursor
    }
    pageInfo {
      endCursor
      hasNextPage
    }
  }
}
```

